<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sustainable Cities</title>
    <style>
     body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-image: url('https://energync.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/CleanvNotClean-image2021v3.jpg');
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        background-attachment: fixed; /* Keeps the background fixed */
        opacity: 0.9; /* Adjust the transparency of the background image */
        animation: backgroundAnimate 15s linear infinite; /* Faster animation for background movement */
}

@keyframes backgroundAnimate {
    0% {
        background-position: 100% 50%; /* Start from the right */
    }
    100% {
        background-position: 0% 50%; /* Move to the left */
    }
}


header,
footer,
a {
    color: #333; /* Change text color for better visibility */
}

a {
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s;
}

a:hover {
    color: #cccccc;
}

header {
    color: white;
    padding: 1rem;
    position: relative;
}

header::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 89, 156, 0.8), rgba(0, 89, 156, 0));
    z-index: -1;
}

main {
    padding: 2rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 800px;
    animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
    }
}

h1, h2 {
    color: #eecf3f;
    animation: slideInLeft 1s ease-in-out;
}

@keyframes slideInLeft {
    from {
        transform: translateX(-100%);
        opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
        transform: translateX(0);
        opacity: 1;
    }
}

footer {
    background-color: #79dd35;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    animation: slideInUp 1s ease-in-out;
}

@keyframes slideInUp {
    from {
        transform: translateY(100%);
        opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 1;
    }
}

@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    main {
        width: 100%;
    }
}

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Sustainable Cities</h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        <h2>Welcome to our website!</h2>
        <p>Here, you'll find information about sustainable cities, their benefits, and how we can contribute to their development.</p>
        <h2>What are sustainable cities?</h2>
        <p>Sustainable cities are urban areas that create and maintain the health, safety, and prosperity of their inhabitants, while also protecting the environment. Learn more about sustainable cities in our <a href="#">guide</a>.</p>
    </main>
    <footer>
        &copy; 2024 Sustainable Cities. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
